      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F00690073002000710075006500200063201900650073007400200075006E0020004100720062006F006B002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Où ça, un Séviper ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00F9002000E70061002C00200075006E0020005300E9007600690070006500720020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comment ça, un Arbok ?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais enfin, regarde ce Pokémon à côté de moi...\nTu vois bien que c’est un Séviper, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouvre les yeux !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nRegarde ce Pokémon à côté de moi...\nTu vois bien que c’est un Séviper, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis quand même un homme raisonnable.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe te laisse me montrer ce que tu penses être\nun vrai Séviper, on verra bien qui a raison !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bah alors ? Tu devais pas me montrer un Séviper ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420061006800200061006C006F007200730020003F002000540075002000640065007600610069007300200070006100730020006D00650020006D006F006E007400720065007200200075006E0020005300E9007600690070006500720020003F00100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, tu m’as apporté un Séviper ?\nVoyons à quoi il ressemble...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002C0020007400750020006D2019006100730020006100700070006F0072007400E900200075006E0020005300E9007600690070006500720020003F000A0056006F0079006F006E0073002000E0002000710075006F006900200069006C002000720065007300730065006D0062006C0065002E002E002E00100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que je vois là... ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
