      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0074007200650020005300E90076006500720069006E002E002E002E00200043201900650073007400200075006E0020004100720062006F006B002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es en train de me dire que c’est ton Pokémon\nle vrai Séviper... ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEt mon Séverin, alors ? C’est sa forme régionale ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
